From d69dee63c79a9784d5fbccbd6740a300f986d6ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhaosiying12138 <neucszhaopeng2016@163.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 18:31:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/42] feat(amdgpu): add host-native fixture parity adapter

Reuse the sparse host memory oracle and pinned dispatch state for a functional gfx950 XOR fixture. Add page leases and explicit negative/lifetime checks while keeping the real GPU pipeline out of scope.

Checkpoint-ID: CP-0016
Goal-ID: GSIM-001
Plan-Revision: 2
Source-Lock-SHA256: 8c0a6d1d04d5a73ab036ddc56d09ff59f7513077931868bdfac5a763f85a73d4
Evidence-Manifest-SHA256: f775b483fa49bcf1cd6b8bd81816741ad45f4cab62606ff7259d229340f30786
Change-Kind: code
Baseline-Commit: cbf0eae213c5e39c727172b546434287d47b5bbe
